@bank all
// Playtest 2 (item 5, head writer W2): the alarm clock when you go to bed (seat U). TEXTS. {time} the wake time,
// {n} the energy you'll wake with (a percentage), {start} your shift's start.
== alarm.title
- Alarm
== alarm.wake
- Wake at {time}
== alarm.energy
- You'll wake with about {n}% energy.
== alarm.more
- Sleep longer, wake fresher.
== alarm.set
- Set alarm
== alarm.late
- That's after your shift starts at {start}. Set it earlier?
== alarm.toast
- Alarm set for {time}.
== alarm.ring
- Morning. Your alarm's going.
